## Code Review Rules

Prioritize correctness, security, compatibility and direct regressions. Report
findings with evidence, severity, affected path, failure condition and validation.
For Delta Review, use the confirmed finding IDs and changed commit range; include
direct regressions from the fixes and request a new Full Review if scope expands.
